ex:CR10_NoAnalogies a backlog:ChangeRequest ;
    backlog:hasChangeDirection backlog:Direction_Grow ;
    backlog:hasChangeRequestRationale "Owner's ruling of 2026-11-24 (content, not a verbatim quotation): there are to be no everyday analogies anywhere in the course materials (decks, pages, chapter code, generators), because they mislead. Applied to chapters 10 and 11 in the urgency lineage on 2026-11-25. The ruling covers the whole course, so the two chapters of this lineage must meet it too, and the page of chapter 17 must not be built from a deck that still has them. The Owner's go-ahead of 2026-11-25 13:45 (OK, proceed) resumes this lineage; reading that go-ahead to include this ruling is my reading, stated here." ;
    backlog:hasDisposition backlog:Disp_Accepted ;
    backlog:requestsChangeTo ex:Scope10 ;
    rdfs:label "Chapters 17 and 16 carry plain explanations, not everyday analogies"@en .
