ex:Mission10 a backlog:Mission ;
    backlog:hasMissionOrigin "Owner's instruction 2026-11-15 (correct the earlier chapters as urgency), 2026-11-18 ('first the corrections; reduce the rework') and the choice 'Close; open chapters 16-17 next' of 2026-11-18." ;
    backlog:hasMissionOutcome backlog:Out_Achieved ;
    backlog:hasMissionStatement "The chapter 17 (PDF and Word Documents) and chapter 16 (SQLite Databases) decks and interactive pages, already released, are corrected so that they meet the six rulings of 2026-11-14 on decks and pages (one thing taught per slide, notes that carry the lecture, a Slide code tab, plain code without prompts, only taught Python, checks and reviews recorded before release), with each chapter's approved content, stories and examples unchanged, reusing the conversion built for chapter 18" ;
    backlog:missionFor ex:Backlog10 ;
    rdfs:label "Chapters 16 and 17 decks and pages meet the owner's rulings of 2026-11-14"@en .
ex:MissionAmendment10_1 a backlog:MissionAmendment ;
    backlog:amendedBy backlog:Owner ;
    backlog:amendedMissionStatement "The chapter 17 (PDF and Word Documents) and chapter 16 (SQLite Databases) decks and interactive pages, already released, are corrected so that they meet the six rulings of 2026-11-14 on decks and pages (one thing taught per slide, notes that carry the lecture, a Slide code tab, plain code without prompts, only taught Python, checks and reviews recorded before release), with each chapter's approved content, stories and examples unchanged, reusing the conversion built for chapter 18 Chapter 11 (Organizing Files) is added to the same mission and is corrected first, as urgent work, with the latest enhancements of CME and SEN0414 and the corrections and remedies recorded so far applied from the physical files." ;
    backlog:amendmentReason "The owner called chapter 11 urgent on 2026-11-18 15:04; the lineage is not yet running, so a pause does not apply, and the work is the same kind as the mission." ;
    backlog:amendmentRuling "Owner instruction of 2026-11-18 15:04 Istanbul: 'I need the chapter 11 urgently with the latest enhancements in CME and SEN0414 obeying the rules and best practices, remedy of the mistakes and application of the corrections but not from memory but physical files.'" ;
    backlog:amendsMission ex:Mission10 ;
    rdfs:label "Mission 10 widened to chapter 11, first"@en .
ex:MissionAmendment10_2 a backlog:MissionAmendment ;
    backlog:amendedBy backlog:Owner ;
    backlog:amendedMissionStatement "The chapter 17 (PDF and Word Documents) and chapter 16 (SQLite Databases) decks and interactive pages, already released, are corrected so that they meet the six rulings of 2026-11-14 on decks and pages (one thing taught per slide, notes that carry the lecture, a Slide code tab, plain code without prompts, only taught Python, checks and reviews recorded before release), with each chapter's approved content, stories and examples unchanged, reusing the conversion built for chapter 18 Chapter 11 (Organizing Files) is added to the same mission and is corrected first, as urgent work, with the latest enhancements of CME and SEN0414 and the corrections and remedies recorded so far applied from the physical files. Chapter 10 (Reading and Writing Files) is added to the same mission, after chapter 11 and before chapters 17 and 16. Chapters 10 and 11 are also brought to the practices of the owner's handover of 2026-11-19: each file is versioned on its own once per release (no counter shared between files, an unreleased page rewritten in place), fuller plain-language sentences are carried on the existing slides in speech balloons (no new slides), and the notes are written for the reader of the handed-out slides, not as directions to a presenter. Chapters 17 and 16 take the same practices when their turn comes." ;
    backlog:amendmentReason "The owner asked on 2026-11-19 17:23 for chapters 10 and 11 to be updated this week to the practices of the handover; chapter 11 was just released under the six rulings and now needs the new practices, and chapter 10 is the next chapter of the same kind of work." ;
    backlog:amendmentRuling "Owner instruction of 2026-11-19 17:23 Istanbul with the handover 'HANDOVER_course-materials_to_SEN0414_page-versions-balloon-slides-and-notes_v1_0_0.md': 'You have a handover about the last corrections and enhancements. Read the file, run the ceremonies and update the chapter 10 and 11 for this week. This is an urgency, you can run urgency exception if needed.' The handover's three rules: (1) each file is versioned on its own, once per release; (2) fuller sentences on slides in speech balloons without new slides; (3) reader notes." ;
    backlog:amendsMission ex:Mission10 ;
    rdfs:label "Mission 10 widened to chapter 10 and the practices of the handover of 2026-11-19"@en .
